<h1>About</h1>

<leaf:mfm>
  This blog runs on **Leaf**, a tiny blog server.

  Every page is a .leaf file you can edit from the admin panel, and posts are written in MFM, so text can $[tada dance], $[jelly wobble], turn $[fg.color=e8590c orange], go $[rainbow rainbow] or get $[x2 big].
</leaf:mfm>
